OL,3,GNEWSAInside the seal hospital ready for
OL,4,Aa fluffy baby boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrey seals will soon flock to a corner
OL,7,Fof the east coast to give birth to
OL,8,Fwide-eyed, fluffy pups.
OL,10,FThe sand dunes at Donna Nook Nature
OL,11,FReserve, in Lincolnshire, become a
OL,12,Fhaven for newborns every November and
OL,13,FDecember.
OL,15,FAnd a little further down the coast,
OL,16,Fstaff at the Mablethorpe Seal Sanctuary
OL,17,Fare on standby to help any pups that
OL,18,Fbecome injured or orphaned.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
